{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30274","headline":"越王楼送高梓州入朝 · 薛逢","name":"越王楼送高梓州入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘递初登建外州，倾心喜事富人侯。\n方当游艺依仁日，便到攀辕卧辙秋。\n容听巴歌消子夜，许陪仙躅上危楼。\n欲知恨恋情深处，听取长江旦暮流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}